; worldsheet.eval - the character sheet closes back to where it was opened
; from, even after paging through the party with < and > (Michael, 2026-09-28:
; after > the close box did nothing). `sheet <n>` goes through the same
; OpenCharacterSheet the portrait click and the < > buttons use, and `sheet off`
; through the close box's own resume.
;
; In a level first, then out on the world map, where a wrong resume would drop
; a travelling party into whatever level was last loaded.
logecho on
reset
sheet 0
sheet 1
sheet 2
sheet off
state
leave
sheet 0
sheet 1
sheet off
state
